{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51701","headline":"吊孟浩然（後二句） · 卢延让","name":"吊孟浩然（後二句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉水醉时波尚绿，鹿门吟处草犹生。\n（《舆地纪胜》八二《襄阳府》）（今按：《全唐诗》七一五引《海录碎事》，另有「高据襄阳播盛名，问人人道是诗星」二句，正可合爲一首。\n此二联格律不粘。\n疑原诗爲七律，今仅存二联。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}